/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 89 0 R
/T (Yemen is experiencing one of the worst food crises in the world, driven by years of devastating civil war. The ongoing conflict has destroyed agricultural infrastructure, blocked food imports, and displaced millions of farming families. Yemen imports over 90% of its basic food supplies, making it extremely vulnerable to supply chain disruption.)
