/Title (Sudan faces a catastrophic food crisis triggered by the outbreak of war between the Sudanese Armed Forces and the Rapid Support Forces in 2023. Millions have been displaced, farmland has been abandoned, and food markets have collapsed across large parts of the country, pushing Sudan to the brink of famine.)
